<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>Skills, sincerity, and <span class="gold-text">barakah</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Earn With Ali Bhai is a learning platform built on a simple idea: real skills, taught honestly, change lives.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <h2>Our story</h2>
      <p>Earn With Ali Bhai began with a frustration — too many young people were being sold shortcuts, hype, and empty promises. What they actually needed was much simpler: practical skills, taught step by step, by someone who genuinely cares whether they succeed.</p>
      <p>So we built a different kind of learning platform. Every course here is structured like a real path: start at zero, learn in the right order, track your progress, and finish with skills you can actually use.</p>
      <h2>Our mission</h2>
      <p>To help students build real, practical skills with honesty and faith-grounded values — so their work brings both rizq and barakah.</p>
      <h2>Our values</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><strong>Tawakkul</strong> — work hard, trust Allah with the results</li>
        <li><strong>Honesty</strong> — no hype, no false promises, no shortcuts sold as secrets</li>
        <li><strong>Consistency</strong> — small daily progress beats occasional intensity</li>
        <li><strong>Halal growth</strong> — success that you can feel good about</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

