      <span class="eyebrow">Founder</span>
      <h2>Ali Bhai</h2>
      <p>Ali Bhai has mentored <strong>300+ students</strong> in building practical, skill-based careers. His teaching style is direct and honest: clear lessons, real examples, and no fluff.</p>
      <p>He believes a student's effort deserves a teacher's sincerity — and that's the standard every course on this platform is held to.</p>
